{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 648,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b327ffe6f4f85f0aec02d3ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有意见表示期待决赛是「目白家对决」喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "efc708433b31b5acd56f0fb98b904897ddd3240e1194ff5cb2af3be0f18b9dec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "328"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:906e1c16a09782de8ae6d719",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "多伯总是给人很冷静的感觉呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "69174a6b663a21199636e11c1ce189de4cf4e6a82a8de8910c38dc5f54f5c145",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "329"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d5d2b2a44214fc7f242627c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你能在背负沉重压力下获胜，实在了不起！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82fc2b9ffad0bd6e7b456675dde9b4f36c2723ad3679feb62e89ae0789a2a116",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "33"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ce3459f9a25890f126b344b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对决赛的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d821453d4f1dae85b0dff7a37264b0b651ac12ba73a6603a006410efbb4437b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "330"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43f4a79297652df286fbc102",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "应该会就这样朝着优胜直直奔去对吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac87967a37b750396c7f512bc8914344ef4dd02dfed17c9fefcd2dcaff95295e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "331"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa4a47d9519772559343bbe1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你是以什么样的心情去挑战竞赛的呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bf8e368bee15ba557f168ccdcce45138bdbddf7a100cf96bbb7c14cc544b5d4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "332"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7a68cb139743e78b988503b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚刚起就持续不断的「帝王口号」是……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7513a50a2c0fa6b1b93f90400a44ba286a843c6ce3fb99c58ecbf928e9bf9d7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "333"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca110357c755f8253d514bef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可以预见决赛时会聚集更多的强敌……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b0173c736b29597ea9675e440991360bd7b5c1e269c845501883708661123d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "334"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76fff57b49576c665d73e97d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4120d78fbf1092e6b2fafd181fece9e0af0ec5b78238248d9a4228d438d3c77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "335"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f42546c6678647d3abae2a5e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "可预见决赛时会与更强的强敌交战吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdf6f82785a7a4d7f42b80ac44fa0dbdb7166232dd6c19e1c866698a5ac04893",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "336"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:963c460a10e8e8e86ab18684",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你现在的心情！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ffcd377e6a6ac7132795adaf740ff989cc0e8321a870fd489f4f9efd43ec2ab",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "337"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da6b550875c939bc9a80af9e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "真是漂亮的胜利呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ac9b5d397b49d533b005a6801d0678d2d34c210d01d5f532e74ab71977c763",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "338"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c4106042a8826d0d7a807bf8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "ファンの皆さんに一言お願いします！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2f6147bb4e79946d933c59b7f4054fdb58b49fbca5d13f23f35a365689bfb45",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "339"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df3b7057a269f6fe3331a6ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "感觉你并不想把路让出来给后辈呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b48b82cd945e69821a3b563f38f97076f2c686fae1f0946935eb3446d733bd3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "34"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04e2f2fe2da07346ae511996",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "お食事にもこだわっていると伺いましたが？",
      "source_fingerprint": "59e988bd8dd21f21c866c9f851160a019d27c599d6c5e04f5666359de61fe863",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "340"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f108bdc9502959d7921ea56c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "次のレースへの意気込みをどうぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95e5dfe2a65c11074b2b5afc41f09a2a9c3e7343a57a3251231f99ddcf5208da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "341"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d67a2cd1b0786a1b7ebfa7da",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "果然还是得用「KP」来庆祝胜利吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a65b71b3fdcfabd238f02b3eb16daf77f4bf8b115480465b73317b99e4a3740",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "342"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a96f4ae1c19f75440e83200",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我就开门见山地问了。你这次获胜的原因是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e84102aeb6900864a07e29717c41c6131dc7fd99e670c8689f1ef8615a7dfe3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "343"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faceec38a7b8ea4b7f76247d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有想要和谁分享这次的胜利吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee1ee145612a0d327e79ec086f70da837cafad83ac27eab3ab6eec0b606e8b5a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "344"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2c0ae302ada7df2dc1fd136",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "麻烦请对粉丝们说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d2a2521fda0060b91cb348ee1e4f8f461af10cf4db5a765907ecbec06849c85f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "345"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36f78d12f2fc38a332b55351",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顺利通过预赛！身边的人应该都很开心吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "827411865fe261ed68a3af6d5816c37e4ed0164f292e1144188abfd408b9a06d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "346"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0888d47287dd5ee15758ae1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "为了决赛，请问你会做什么样的准备呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa01857402cc0ca5ec49f439ff5315d55258eb54d632948be9e0c0456353e48f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "347"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd1ff4911a927f4146d5c900",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有吃致胜料理吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "20cf6cc637548e0b8cf551b62545eb7b5ba2f12c2844a44e75aef72f7a0e2aad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "348"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee2b938e84f4b66d8f13a0e6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在有比赛的日子会做些什么特别的事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3b3e5dc1e095380a52bbcec11fe7feced5e5ae9e7a91ee88f4941a27cbc74025",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "349"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:872a39903ef228654348690e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "那种威风凛凛的表现究竟是从何而来……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fe97118a8bd373480ffaa70e2f57c08fe7427b71cc072a02573f7cfa7263b37",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "35"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2981632f06caf844017f2f9b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "顺利进入决赛了呢！身边的人应该都很开心吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c7852df0e2b9c7a9d89230d7e900a414a3df9df105c5e4330ffbb351b99bc19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "350"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:796e404b84ac2d6bced302f2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请向竞赛对手发表一些感想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b2ca90e0f7c4bad8abad229c7399817c98239adb0949124f352333ed17176f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "351"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:251023cc091c38611139c91c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛时会对上更难应付的强者赛马娘吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "36b71aa30bf6e25e2b4d067f97d20ef0fa696672432649dd36af5bee647c49d2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "352"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:67441c1a903dc76f916dd7a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为「辉煌逸才」的你正备受瞩目呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5a4bc2064acd1cbe499b57f6603474c9bb367267570d0641410bfc038cd33cc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "353"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be35896ec16fd766963750d4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说你的写作功力在课堂上被夸奖了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f02e4e18ea4734f34d9b7d719668ac46c209bea7f52c9e2768c7af0b942f1436",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "354"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:511a926f44b494642227e509",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最近引起你注意的赛马娘是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f437e38f2486140cf537a453cb6c41faf07f2df8d093879f3a71badeae1a274",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "355"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34358a53fb5214614fa64804",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "竞赛开始前会紧张吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e50565654cc4a1be28f0f43c9e3d1db0e5a46787cd97002bdb603824ba6284e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "356"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54617d498ed51ade692cebde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很精彩的表现！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee6b959a9629f3fe045615523dfffcfe79a9e1848e1e4ef33c00288ff9dc6c60",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "357"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b70a1a6310b6eb120b1df8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "刚才好像看到你在笔记本上写了什么……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74aa498367c5e045572edbc5e2da26810a31ad3e5ede20b61b19ea31d204621",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "358"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3f2eb2a52f3b377de3ccea5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "有无论如何都想在决赛中一战的赛马娘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c8c1079c8c0c7383df7621a618edbe3bc582689792fdc93483fd7288fc65bb3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "359"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4ec188f231941c7104782a6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "与你的母亲不相上下的精彩表现呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bc151be538000a1ecbc3eef35d2bc119c4d00549d2fe9306cf092259e591e09",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "36"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2d3d307c484e9a3b6db3d73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请告诉大家让你维持坚强实力的饮食是什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67054bf358b9d3cb5a1cfffe8a68d52cfed9a64dac3f832684e447ff3b4d88bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "360"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef2f8c230eba767ff97d9a6e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "据说，你好像有在养狗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46f44d166fc62fdad7a8103afb9730399b72efdf8fa8ae47ece7be525b75948e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "361"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6c583f188b10a7e266df0b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛该关注哪个部分？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0eb1042c76c0e83870cc6d0e6a95ab4a043cb9bc82063118d0c2ca8e473dfe8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "362"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9567943318460a28e68419f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对粉丝发表一句感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5af0f64085ff6426a046679705388129f151c4ca7bad839a95ba1f0a10f1be",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "363"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3f0b2b210b1b2f700e1bb73",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "今天的竞赛跑起来感觉如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dcb831c7d2173e9f1415f269506db84a459b5517da313301dd1ab5fba6883eba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "364"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46cdf308991eebc6882b2438",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请说说你对决赛的抱负！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d821453d4f1dae85b0dff7a37264b0b651ac12ba73a6603a006410efbb4437b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "365"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d614327c0866368df104f70b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对如同竞赛师父般的训练员说句话！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1784f5d02fcb63863e930927059a29c82196082fd6b3c2c55a4dbb08b41a1e93",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "366"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c079b6884c031444ccb304b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "请对位于故乡道场的众人发表感言！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e0fa6ff124258607abd0468c840fcbfeb934723d6af427cbd326cb3369544b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "367"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f1ce1e0e1e827cf0e4df3e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身为一名武术家，你认为竞赛是？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4528237471640844c4b6b9f65886edb343b2cc0821f555ad4dbe5739e1100933",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "368"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae7d21bc4b5bce55a675e94a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你带着满面的开怀笑容抵达了终点呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1018c6a9ab57b17a2fcb1feb9a66fa3e085fc55351c54f987f3745ed71fb6c46",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "37"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3efab5d2bfb049e938da6c75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "决赛上可能会聚集更多强敌赛马娘喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ada7199e312933d75ab8d125722ce5b0fdb1247c50caf6eaf068a67c1e16d72",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "372"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:292ea09b53c401509a7adecf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在决赛上有可能要与目白家的成员一战喔？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7b3a38951329cd6f7755c0f0249b7f62a50bd6bfd55986e100bc7928b4a33e6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "231",
        "373"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8e882a37a1c70a170d8122a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下场竞赛会用什么样的作战去跑呢！？",
